# mhVTL runtime directories.
#
# Created on boot by systemd-tmpfiles on systemd systems, and by
# opentmpfiles / bootclean where those process /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d. The
# daemons also create the lock directory on demand (see
# check_for_running_daemons()), so this is not the only path that creates it.
#
#   /run/mhvtl       TCMU handler socket (/run/mhvtl/tcmu_handler.sock)
#   /run/lock/mhvtl  per-drive / per-library lock files (vtltape, vtllibrary)
#
#   /run/mhvtl/fifo  suggested location of a device's status FIFO (fifo:)
#
# The daemons used to spell these /var/run and /var/lock, which resolve
# here via the standard symlinks.
d /run/mhvtl 0755 root root -
d /run/lock/mhvtl 0750 root root -
